# 🏆 HearthLeap（梯悦）

**版本：0.1.8** · **源码发布计划** · 中文 / English

> “梯悦”寓意在天梯旅程中享受进步与乐趣。HearthLeap 是一个面向学习与代码交流的实验性桌面项目。本仓库计划仅发布源代码，不提供预编译程序或打包运行文件。
>
> “梯悦” means finding joy in the climb toward Legend. HearthLeap is an experimental desktop project for learning and code exchange. This repository is intended to publish source code only, not prebuilt executables or bundled releases.

