## 🤝 反馈 / Feedback

发布后可通过 GitHub Issues 提交界面问题、文档勘误或非自动对局相关的改进建议。提交内容前请移除日志中的个人信息、账号标识和令牌。

After publication, use GitHub Issues for UI issues, documentation corrections, or improvements unrelated to automated live gameplay. Remove personal information, account identifiers, and tokens from logs before sharing them.
